[model] 
[model] Thread Safety:
[model]     This implementation uses a combination of internal locks and atomic
[model]     operations to ensure thread safety. The `set` and `get` operations
[model]     are atomic, meaning no other thread can modify the cache while these
[model]     operations are in progress.
[model] 
[model] Performance Considerations:
[model]     - O(1) average time complexity for get and set operations.
[model]     - O(n) worst case for eviction, but amortized O(1) with LRU.
